<title>USA: Rehabilicare gets European certification.</title>
<headline>Rehabilicare gets European certification.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRIGHTON, Minn. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rehabilicare Inc said Thursday the company received European certification issued by TUV Rheinland, an independent accredited registrar.</p>
<p>The certifications are for the design, development, production and servicing of electrotherapy products used for rehabilitation and pain management.</p>
<p>Rehabilicare designs and manufactures electromedical pain management and rehabilitation products.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
